[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "start": 2.67,
    "end": 7.83,
    "text": "First into the tank is a product that protects, but doesn't hide what you want to flaunt."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": 15.75,
    "end": 23.67,
    "text": "Hello sharks, I'm Cody Jet Burdar, and I'm Jordan Rubin we're from Encino, California sharks were so proud to be here today"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": 23.67,
    "end": 29.83,
    "text": "We're seeking two hundred and fifty thousand dollars in exchange for five percent share in our automotive brand where we have"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": 29.83,
    "end": 32.63,
    "text": "reinvented custom vehicle protection."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": 32.63,
    "end": 35.47,
    "text": "Sharks, if you own a car, protect it."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": 35.47,
    "end": 39.35,
    "text": "From rain, dust, scratches, and from the jealous neighbors,"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": 39.35,
    "end": 41.55,
    "text": "the solution is a cover."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": 41.55,
    "end": 43.15,
    "text": "So Sharks, what we've done is created"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": 43.15,
    "end": 45.83,
    "text": "something very special, and here it is."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": 45.83,
    "end": 48.51,
    "text": "It's an old, plain, clean car cover."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": 48.51,
    "end": 49.43,
    "text": "What's going on?"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": 49.43,
    "end": 51.03,
    "text": "What is that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": 51.03,
    "end": 51.87,
    "text": "Oh, it's Bill!"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": 51.87,
    "end": 52.83,
    "text": "Oh my god!"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": 52.83,
    "end": 53.67,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": 53.67,
    "end": 54.99,
    "text": "It's Bill Goldberg!"
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": 54.99,
    "end": 55.99,
    "text": "Bill Goldberg!"
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": 55.99,
    "end": 56.99,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": 56.99,
    "end": 61.99,
    "text": "I'm Bill Goldberg, former Georgia Bulldog, Atlanta Falcon,"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": 62.99,
    "end": 67.99,
    "text": "and multiple-time WCW and WWE World Heavyweight Champion."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": 67.99,
    "end": 68.99,
    "text": "You're damn right."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": 68.99,
    "end": 69.99,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": 69.99,
    "end": 71.99,
    "text": "What the hell are you guys doing?"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": 71.99,
    "end": 72.99,
    "text": "Whoa."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": 72.99,
    "end": 74.99,
    "text": "What are you doing?"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": 74.99,
    "end": 76.99,
    "text": "You brought me out here for that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": 76.99,
    "end": 77.99,
    "text": "I'm sorry."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": 77.99,
    "end": 78.99,
    "text": "Sorry, Bill."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": 78.99,
    "end": 80.99,
    "text": "Oh my gosh."
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": 80.99,
    "end": 81.99,
    "text": "This is awesome."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": 81.99,
    "end": 83.99,
    "text": "Oh my gosh."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": 83.99,
    "end": 90.31,
    "text": "My gosh, this is awesome. Oh my god. What is that? Now that is"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": 91.43,
    "end": 94.79,
    "text": "More like it. Yes. Yes. It is sharks"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "start": 95.75,
    "end": 97.75,
    "text": "May I present to you?"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "start": 100.95,
    "end": 106.87,
    "text": "Sharks hero covers creates custom photorealistic vehicle covers that match the exact car underneath"
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "start": 106.87,
    "end": 108.87,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "start": 108.87,
    "end": 111.87,
    "text": "Down to the wheels, the headlights, the paint."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "start": 111.87,
    "end": 113.87,
    "text": "So even when your car is protected,"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "start": 113.87,
    "end": 115.87,
    "text": "it will still look showroom-ready."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "start": 115.87,
    "end": 117.87,
    "text": "Don't hide your car, Kevin!"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "start": 117.87,
    "end": 118.87,
    "text": "Celebrate it!"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "start": 118.87,
    "end": 121.87,
    "text": "So Sharks, who's next?"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "start": 121.87,
    "end": 124.87,
    "text": "To suit up and get covered by Hero Covers."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "start": 124.87,
    "end": 127.87,
    "text": "Wow, great job, guys!"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "start": 127.87,
    "end": 130.87,
    "text": "Guys, that was great, bad theater."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "start": 130.87,
    "end": 134.87,
    "text": "I literally have a cover on my 60A Mustang GT500,"
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "start": 134.87,
    "end": 137.33,
    "text": "and it is ugly, and it is silver,"
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "start": 137.33,
    "end": 139.33,
    "text": "and I'm embarrassed because it's the beautiful car,"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "start": 139.33,
    "end": 140.37,
    "text": "and I wish I had that."
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "start": 140.37,
    "end": 142.97,
    "text": "That's how my garage used to be before I met them."
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "start": 142.97,
    "end": 145.33,
    "text": "This is really, really cute."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "start": 145.33,
    "end": 146.17,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "start": 146.17,
    "end": 148.37,
    "text": "I've never seen anything like it."
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "start": 148.37,
    "end": 149.21,
    "text": "Thank you, Laurie."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "start": 149.21,
    "end": 150.37,
    "text": "Do I order by model?"
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "start": 150.37,
    "end": 152.33,
    "text": "Have you already printed the standards?"
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "start": 152.33,
    "end": 155.33,
    "text": "Like if I have a Porsche 911 2020 version,"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "start": 155.33,
    "end": 156.33,
    "text": "you've got that already?"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "start": 156.33,
    "end": 158.17,
    "text": "Kevin, we know you're a huge car guy"
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "start": 158.17,
    "end": 159.41,
    "text": "and a Porsche collector,"
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "start": 159.41,
    "end": 161.63,
    "text": "so we've made the process super simple."
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "start": 161.63,
    "end": 164.13,
    "text": "For this custom photo-realistic car cover,"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "start": 164.13,
    "end": 169.89,
    "text": "All you do, select the photorealistic option, enter your year, make, and model, select your"
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "start": 169.89,
    "end": 174.21,
    "text": "material option, and you can customize your license plate for free."
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "start": 174.21,
    "end": 175.21,
    "text": "We'll do the rest."
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "start": 175.21,
    "end": 176.69,
    "text": "What do you sell it for?"
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "start": 176.69,
    "end": 181.09,
    "text": "So this exact cover that you're looking at right here is $745 delivered."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "start": 181.09,
    "end": 182.09,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "start": 182.09,
    "end": 185.65,
    "text": "And what is that in comparison to just like a standard cover?"
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "start": 185.65,
    "end": 188.81,
    "text": "Covers are selling on Amazon as low as $30."
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "start": 188.81,
    "end": 189.81,
    "text": "Those suck."
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "start": 189.81,
    "end": 194.85,
    "text": "The form fitting covers can retail for four to six hundred dollars and even go beyond that."
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "start": 194.85,
    "end": 196.53,
    "text": "It is so hard to do this."
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "start": 196.53,
    "end": 197.53,
    "text": "You have no idea."
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "start": 197.53,
    "end": 198.53,
    "text": "This is very difficult."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "start": 198.53,
    "end": 200.03,
    "text": "We've created this process from the ground up."
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "start": 200.03,
    "end": 205.61,
    "text": "Our photorealistic process of uploading photos and taking vector images combined with"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "start": 205.61,
    "end": 208.21,
    "text": "our 3D artistry is unmatched."
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "start": 208.21,
    "end": 210.09,
    "text": "Bill, how are you involved in this?"
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "start": 210.09,
    "end": 211.09,
    "text": "Like what are you an investor?"
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "start": 211.09,
    "end": 215.01,
    "text": "I own five percent of the company and I have 40 cars in my garage."
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "start": 215.01,
    "end": 217.41,
    "text": "When you're in your garage you can identify them now."
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "start": 217.41,
    "end": 220.41,
    "text": "Every single car that I have has a story."
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "start": 220.41,
    "end": 222.41,
    "text": "I do not want to cover that car up."
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "start": 222.41,
    "end": 224.41,
    "text": "I want to be able to view that car,"
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "start": 224.41,
    "end": 227.41,
    "text": "but that car has to be protected at the same time."
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "start": 227.41,
    "end": 228.41,
    "text": "There you go."
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "start": 228.41,
    "end": 229.41,
    "text": "There you go."
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "start": 229.41,
    "end": 230.41,
    "text": "That's my garage."
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "start": 230.41,
    "end": 232.41,
    "text": "How did you all meet?"
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "start": 232.41,
    "end": 235.41,
    "text": "Bill is a well-known car collector in the industry."
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "start": 235.41,
    "end": 238.41,
    "text": "We pitched him similar to how we're pitching you guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "start": 238.41,
    "end": 239.41,
    "text": "I love it."
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "start": 239.41,
    "end": 241.41,
    "text": "We brought him as a strategic advisor early on,"
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "start": 241.41,
    "end": 243.41,
    "text": "almost pre-revenue."
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "start": 243.41,
    "end": 245.41,
    "text": "Great story, but now we've got to get to the numbers."
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "start": 245.41,
    "end": 247.41,
    "text": "Tell us what it cost to manufacture."
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "start": 247.41,
    "end": 249.41,
    "text": "Of course, yes, sir. Walk us through it all."
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "start": 249.41,
    "end": 251.41,
    "text": "Yes, sir. So, this cover right here,"
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "start": 251.41,
    "end": 254.41,
    "text": "delivered, is about $240."
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "start": 254.41,
    "end": 257.41,
    "text": "That includes the print, the cut, the sew,"
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "start": 257.41,
    "end": 259.41,
    "text": "the delivery as well, and the design."
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "start": 259.41,
    "end": 261.41,
    "text": "Of course, these don't just design themselves."
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "start": 261.41,
    "end": 263.41,
    "text": "We have a team of artists in-house."
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "start": 263.41,
    "end": 265.41,
    "text": "Okay, so what's the customer acquisition cost?"
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "start": 265.41,
    "end": 267.41,
    "text": "When we first started, it was like $120,"
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "start": 267.41,
    "end": 269.41,
    "text": "and now it's all the way down to $75."
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "start": 269.41,
    "end": 271.41,
    "text": "What are you going to do this year in sales?"
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "start": 271.41,
    "end": 273.41,
    "text": "This year in sales, we're projected to do"
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "start": 273.41,
    "end": 275.21,
    "text": "to do 1.2 to 1.4 million."
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "start": 275.21,
    "end": 276.85,
    "text": "Oh, what are you going to make this year?"
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "start": 276.85,
    "end": 278.53,
    "text": "We're going to make about $200,000."
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "start": 278.53,
    "end": 280.85,
    "text": "Our plan is to become the fanatics of the automotive"
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "start": 280.85,
    "end": 283.25,
    "text": "industry and take on all the licenses"
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "start": 283.25,
    "end": 286.29,
    "text": "from all the major OEMs, all the different lifestyle brands."
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "start": 286.29,
    "end": 289.97,
    "text": "So I mean, I'm interested, but if I'm going to wet my beak,"
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "start": 289.97,
    "end": 291.93,
    "text": "how do I get my money back?"
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "start": 291.93,
    "end": 293.49,
    "text": "Like this is a situation where it's"
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "start": 293.49,
    "end": 295.93,
    "text": "a never-ending use of capital to acquire customers."
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "start": 295.93,
    "end": 297.65,
    "text": "Well, I know how I'll get my money back."
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "start": 297.65,
    "end": 298.93,
    "text": "I have an offer for you guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "start": 298.93,
    "end": 299.43,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "start": 299.43,
    "end": 299.93,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "start": 299.93,
    "end": 301.49,
    "text": "Let's see, Sean."
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "start": 301.49,
    "end": 302.73,
    "text": "You may not like it."
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "start": 302.73,
    "end": 304.09,
    "text": "That's what I'm here for."
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "start": 306.59,
    "end": 310.97,
    "text": "You guys want 250K for 5%, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "start": 310.97,
    "end": 314.13,
    "text": "I'll give you $4.5 million for 90% of your company."
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "start": 314.13,
    "end": 314.63,
    "text": "Whoa."
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "start": 314.63,
    "end": 315.13,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "start": 318.49,
    "end": 320.21,
    "text": "All sharks are still in."
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "start": 320.21,
    "end": 322.95,
    "text": "Jordan, Bill, and Cody have a surprising offer"
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "start": 322.95,
    "end": 325.41,
    "text": "on the table from Rashaun for their custom car"
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "start": 325.41,
    "end": 328.29,
    "text": "cover company Hero Covers."
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "start": 328.29,
    "end": 331.89,
    "text": "You guys want 250K for 5%, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "start": 331.89,
    "end": 333.51,
    "text": "I'll give you four and a half million dollars"
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "start": 333.51,
    "end": 334.85,
    "text": "for 90% of your company."
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "start": 336.35,
    "end": 338.93,
    "text": "And sign a two-year employment agreement with you."
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "start": 338.93,
    "end": 340.09,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "start": 340.09,
    "end": 341.93,
    "text": "So you went from running a company"
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "start": 341.93,
    "end": 343.05,
    "text": "to becoming his employee."
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "start": 343.05,
    "end": 343.89,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "start": 343.89,
    "end": 345.53,
    "text": "What do you think of that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "start": 345.53,
    "end": 347.77,
    "text": "Rashawn, we really appreciate that offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "start": 347.77,
    "end": 348.81,
    "text": "It's your same valuation."
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "start": 348.81,
    "end": 349.65,
    "text": "I just want more equity."
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "start": 349.65,
    "end": 351.57,
    "text": "We really appreciate that offer that shows you that."
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "start": 351.57,
    "end": 353.37,
    "text": "I don't think you're here to sell out control."
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "start": 353.37,
    "end": 354.33,
    "text": "Not sell the business."
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "start": 354.33,
    "end": 356.25,
    "text": "So I'll give you another offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "start": 356.25,
    "end": 359.93,
    "text": "I'll give you the 250,000 for 15%."
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "start": 359.93,
    "end": 361.25,
    "text": "But I want distributions"
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "start": 361.25,
    "end": 362.77,
    "text": "when the company distributes,"
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "start": 362.77,
    "end": 366.71,
    "text": "because I don't know how I get my capital back."
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "start": 366.71,
    "end": 368.35,
    "text": "All right guys, I love this."
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "start": 368.35,
    "end": 370.35,
    "text": "I'm gonna make you an offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "start": 370.35,
    "end": 374.95,
    "text": "I'm gonna do 15%, but I would need $50 per car covered"
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "start": 374.95,
