    "end": 418.12,
    "text": "to make it more competitive."
  },
  {
    "id": 183,
    "start": 418.12,
    "end": 418.88,
    "text": "Oh, go ahead, Kevin."
  },
  {
    "id": 184,
    "start": 418.88,
    "end": 420.04,
    "text": "I want to squeeze some heads."
  },
  {
    "id": 185,
    "start": 420.04,
    "end": 423.16,
    "text": "Before we do that, one second, I love your hustle."
  },
  {
    "id": 186,
    "start": 423.16,
    "end": 424.16,
    "text": "You're so passionate."
  },
  {
    "id": 187,
    "start": 424.16,
    "end": 425.16,
    "text": "I know, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 188,
    "start": 425.16,
    "end": 426.16,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 189,
    "start": 426.16,
    "end": 427.76,
    "text": "I'm going to go down from 15% to 10%."
  },
  {
    "id": 190,
    "start": 427.76,
    "end": 429.6,
    "text": "You can keep more of your equity."
  },
  {
    "id": 191,
    "start": 429.6,
    "end": 431.96,
    "text": "I'll keep the $50 so that I just get my money back."
  },
  {
    "id": 192,
    "start": 431.96,
    "end": 432.96,
    "text": "I don't need that."
  },
  {
    "id": 193,
    "start": 432.96,
    "end": 435.16,
    "text": "I still think he's too greedy, so here's a new counter."
  },
  {
    "id": 194,
