    "end": 442.16,
    "text": "are on the table."
  },
  {
    "id": 198,
    "start": 442.16,
    "end": 443.96,
    "text": "I want to get twice on my cash back."
  },
  {
    "id": 199,
    "start": 443.96,
    "end": 445.96,
    "text": "You're learning from the Mexican royalty?"
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
