  },
  {
    "id": 220,
    "start": 481.3,
    "end": 483.0,
    "text": "And then you are just going to get a loan."
  },
  {
    "id": 221,
    "start": 483.0,
    "end": 483.5,
    "text": "It's non-dilution."
  },
  {
    "id": 222,
    "start": 483.5,
    "end": 484.3,
    "text": "Same dilution."
  },
  {
    "id": 223,
    "start": 484.3,
    "end": 484.8,
    "text": "I don't get it."
  },
  {
    "id": 224,
    "start": 484.8,
    "end": 486.1,
    "text": "I don't think it's back within a year or whatever."
  },
  {
    "id": 225,
    "start": 486.1,
    "end": 488.5,
    "text": "But it's not 200% of our investments."
  },
  {
    "id": 226,
    "start": 488.5,
    "end": 491.1,
    "text": "But remember, we don't really see anything out"
  },
  {
    "id": 227,
    "start": 491.1,
    "end": 495.7,
    "text": "of those advisory shares unless we make you very, very rich."
